+/// Vollie 2's page touch (llama.cpp patch c1-olmoe 0012, in libllama): starts a helper on the little cores that reads
+/// one byte per page of the model mapping that is resident now, every VOLLIE_TOUCH_S seconds, until [touchEnd]. 0 =
+/// started, -1 = VOLLIE_TOUCH unset, -2 = no model mapped. Throws on a runtime without it (Vollie 1 classic).
+int touchBegin() => DynamicLibrary.open('libllama.so')
